{
  "title": "Winey Gooey Brazilian Fish Papillote",
  "description": "A lazy Sunday dish featuring fish cooked in a flavorful wine and lemon juice sauce, wrapped in papillote for a moist and tender result, with anti-inflammatory friendly ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "brazilian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
